Package: scDoubletConsensus
Title: Consensus Doublet Detection for Single-Cell RNA-Seq Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Andrew", "Choi Lab", email = "p010417pjh@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Quality control and doublet-detection toolkit for scRNA-seq data.
    Instead of taking the intersection of calls from multiple doublet
    detectors, scDoubletConsensus normalizes per-cell confidence scores from
    each tool and builds a rank-based or weighted consensus score. This
    recovers cells that receive high confidence from an individual tool but
    do not appear in the intersection of all tools. Ships with wrappers
    around DoubletFinder and scDblFinder and a QC-filtering step based on
    gene count, RNA abundance, and mitochondrial percentage.
